  "intended_behavior": "Change ONLY v2 Entity.entity_id from string to bytes. Text identifiers use UTF-8 encode on construction and UTF-8 decode for observations. v1 string identifiers and all v1 relay behavior remain unchanged. Preserve the existing standalone sample identifiers in each runtime. For valid UTF-8, empty/Unicode/escaped text must round trip identically. Arbitrary non-UTF-8 bytes and mixed-version interoperability are outside this case; do not invent conversions. The output observation key remains entity_id with a string value. Keep version selection explicit. Never change tests or generated bindings.",
  "change": {
    "id": "v2-identifier-bytes",
    "category": "field_type_changed",
    "old_schema": "syntax = \"proto3\";\n\npackage simulation.v2;\n\nmessage Entity {\n  string entity_id = 1;\n}\n",
    "new_schema": "syntax = \"proto3\";\n\npackage simulation.v2;\n\nmessage Entity {\n  bytes entity_id = 1;\n}\n",
    "schema_path": "proto/v2/entity.proto"
  },
  "affected_files": [
    {
      "path": "runtimes/typescript/main.ts",
      "language": "typescript",
